@startuml
title Implemented REST LLM query expansion
actor Client
participant SearchController
participant SearchService
participant OllamaService
participant "Ollama llama3.2:1b" as LLM
participant InvertedIndex
Client -> SearchController: POST /api/search {query, mode: llm}
SearchController -> SearchService: search(request)
SearchService -> SearchService: validate; stage query_expansion
SearchService -> OllamaService: expandQuery(query)
OllamaService -> LLM: POST /api/generate
model, system, prompt, stream=false, format=json
alt valid response within deadline
 LLM --> OllamaService: {done:true, response: JSON string}
 OllamaService -> OllamaService: validate terms; tokenize; deduplicate; cap additions
preserve all original terms
 OllamaService --> SearchService: Expansion(terms, false, null)
else unavailable / timeout / HTTP error / invalid response
 OllamaService --> SearchService: Expansion(original terms, true, warning code)
end
SearchService -> SearchService: stage keyword_search; capture completed State
loop terms
 SearchService -> InvertedIndex: search(term)
 InvertedIndex --> SearchService: document IDs
end
SearchService -> SearchService: rank and create snippets; stage done
SearchService --> Client: 200 SearchResponse
terms, stages, fallback, warning, results
note right of SearchService
keyword mode skips Ollama entirely.
Stages returned in final REST response.
WebSocket not implemented.
end note
@enduml
